WEBVTT

00:04.500 --> 00:06.460
<b>Yayoi</b>

00:37.420 --> 00:39.920
I hate the supernatural.

00:41.080 --> 00:45.000
I can sense spirits, and a while back, I got tangled up
with a nasty spirit, and a good friend got dragged into it.

00:45.790 --> 00:50.290
I was so afraid of getting anyone else hurt,
that I refused to leave my room for two years.

00:51.460 --> 00:52.210
Thankfully...

00:53.380 --> 01:00.750
the people around me
helped me get out of that dark period,

00:58.380 --> 01:03.210
<b>HOZUKI</b>

01:02.330 --> 01:05.330
and now, I'm finally starting to live life
as a normal college student.

01:03.420 --> 01:06.000
<b>Private Tutor Square</b>

01:05.330 --> 01:09.670
I took a job at a tutoring center
to help rebuild my social skills.

01:08.790 --> 01:10.040
<b>Yayoi Hozuki:</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:10.040
<b>3rd Grade</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:10.040
<b>Scored well above average in 4 subjects</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:10.040
<b>Potential Middle Schools:</b>

01:10.670 --> 01:12.130
Unfortunately...

01:13.670 --> 01:16.670
<b>HOZUKI</b>

01:19.830 --> 01:20.830
Keitaro.

01:22.130 --> 01:24.460
Hey... Yayoi-chan.

01:26.170 --> 01:30.210
They assigned me to my worst possible match...

01:31.000 --> 01:32.710
A girl who can see spirits.

01:34.420 --> 01:42.290
While we walk the world of the living,
the dead drift through the spirit world.

01:43.500 --> 01:49.920
These two worlds sometimes intersect,
allowing evil spirits to do harm to the living.

01:50.790 --> 01:58.170
This young girl is gathering dark power
to slay the spirit who took her loved one.

01:56.080 --> 02:00.670
<b>FATAL CRASHES</b>

01:56.080 --> 02:00.670
<b>IN THIS AREA</b>

01:59.130 --> 02:04.080
The grudges of the dead,
used to pursue a grudge far greater...

03:39.380 --> 03:43.080
Okay, that's all for today. Good work!

03:43.500 --> 03:44.630
Easy-peasy.

03:44.630 --> 03:45.920
Good work, guys!

03:47.330 --> 03:48.670
I saw you putting in the effort.

03:48.880 --> 03:50.580
Thanks, Eiko.

03:51.130 --> 03:53.170
Here's your cocoa, Yayoi-chan.

03:54.040 --> 03:55.580
Talk about customer service.

03:57.290 --> 03:58.210
Keitaro.

03:59.330 --> 04:00.750
<b>TOKYO'S MOST HAUNTED PLACES</b>

03:59.420 --> 04:00.790
Let's go somewhere haunted.

04:00.960 --> 04:02.330
<b>TOKYO'S MOST HAUNTED PLACES</b>

04:02.580 --> 04:04.290
I'd rather die.

04:04.670 --> 04:08.210
S-sorry, I've got plans...

04:08.330 --> 04:09.420
Scaredy-cat.

04:09.420 --> 04:11.040
That's Keitaro for you.

04:11.210 --> 04:12.460
Hey!

04:13.750 --> 04:16.250
I-I actually have plans this time.

04:16.960 --> 04:18.290
Are you getting exorcised?

04:18.630 --> 04:19.920
Yeah, it's that time.

04:20.960 --> 04:21.920
Exorcised?

04:22.130 --> 04:23.960
Yep, exorcised.

04:24.170 --> 04:25.580
Let's gooo...

04:25.580 --> 04:26.540
...ooost!

04:27.710 --> 04:29.670
I shouldn't have caved...

04:30.250 --> 04:32.630
Pwetty pweeze?

04:33.000 --> 04:34.920
Take me wif you?

04:35.080 --> 04:37.290
No! You don't get to come!

04:37.290 --> 04:39.580
It's really far from here! We have to drive overnight!

04:39.580 --> 04:41.170
Aww, c'mon.

04:41.330 --> 04:42.420
Eiko!

04:42.500 --> 04:43.880
Sure, I'll come, too!

04:43.880 --> 04:44.960
What?! Wait...

04:45.880 --> 04:47.920
I can't breathe! I can't...

04:49.380 --> 04:51.960
Why me, man...?

04:52.290 --> 04:56.000
Relax! We're not going anywhere dangerous this time.

04:57.250 --> 05:00.460
Eiko always seems to take Yayoi's side...

05:01.580 --> 05:02.880
Speaking of Eiko...

05:04.290 --> 05:06.750
You love to feel fear.

05:08.250 --> 05:11.040
The hell was that all about?

05:11.040 --> 05:12.210
Hey, Kei-kun!

05:12.210 --> 05:14.210
Huh? What’s up?

05:14.380 --> 05:17.460
Aren't road trips fun?

05:17.580 --> 05:19.670
It's like we're on our own little adventure!

05:21.330 --> 05:23.880
Do you have to get exorcised a lot?

05:23.880 --> 05:25.630
Oh, yeah.

05:26.670 --> 05:29.170
I got cursed a long time ago...

05:29.790 --> 05:31.500
So now I get regular exorcisms.

05:33.250 --> 05:38.130
The shrine we're headed to is run by Kei-kun's grandma!

05:38.710 --> 05:40.420
Keitaro's grandma...

05:47.630 --> 05:49.880
<b>Service Area</b>

06:17.170 --> 06:18.790
Here we are!

06:26.080 --> 06:28.080
You idiot!

06:29.880 --> 06:31.790
What abhorrent creature have you brought here?!

06:32.380 --> 06:33.630
Grandma?!

06:33.630 --> 06:35.330
Smells like alcohol.

06:36.000 --> 06:38.210
Sorry, Kei-chan, but I had to douse you.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.210
You!

06:41.330 --> 06:45.460
You little brat! You destroyed
those jizo statues, didn't you?!

06:45.630 --> 06:47.960
Now you've got five pissed-off jizo haunting you!

06:47.960 --> 06:49.040
What?! Wait...

06:49.580 --> 06:50.460
Not five.

06:55.920 --> 06:56.790
Seven.

06:58.040 --> 06:59.710
What? Seven?!

07:00.420 --> 07:03.710
Grandma's more spiritually sensitive than I am.

07:04.210 --> 07:07.790
But it sounds like Yayoi
can see things even my Grandma can't!

07:07.880 --> 07:09.670
Get the hell outta here!

07:09.670 --> 07:12.330
Stop, Grandma! Stop!

07:10.960 --> 07:11.710
Don't wanna.

07:12.630 --> 07:13.920
Let me at her, Kei-chan!

07:14.130 --> 07:17.540
Why're you defending this little brat?! She's dangerous!

07:17.540 --> 07:18.380
Grandma...

07:18.920 --> 07:24.040
She's not wrong; Yayoi-chan's kind of insane...
and if I'm being honest, she's more than a handful.

07:24.920 --> 07:25.710
Still...

07:25.880 --> 07:30.960
My job asked me to tutor her,
so I have to keep an eye on her, for work...

07:32.750 --> 07:36.580
And I really need to work on my people skills...

07:40.290 --> 07:43.710
Fine, if you're really going to insist...

07:45.290 --> 07:46.750
Listen up, brat.

07:47.330 --> 07:49.460
You mess with Kei-chan in any way,

07:49.670 --> 07:51.130
and I'll make you regret it!

07:52.710 --> 07:56.000
We're ready for your exorcism, Kei-chan.

07:56.580 --> 07:58.290
The anesthesiologist is here, too.

07:58.630 --> 07:59.500
Okay.

08:00.290 --> 08:02.130
Good job, Keitaro.

08:03.710 --> 08:06.670
Thanks, but did you really break those jizo statues?

08:06.880 --> 08:07.460
Yup.

08:07.630 --> 08:09.420
Okay, why?!

08:09.830 --> 08:11.920
Cause they were guarding really nasty spirits.

08:11.920 --> 08:13.330
Which is why you shouldn't have broken them!

08:15.210 --> 08:19.380
One of them might've been the one who took Mommy.

08:21.960 --> 08:25.920
A year and a half ago,
she lost both her parents in a car accident.

08:26.630 --> 08:31.790
I think the reason she wants to go to haunted places...
is because she's looking for her mother.

08:33.330 --> 08:34.580
Yayoi-chan...

08:43.880 --> 08:46.750
Kei-chan, you meditating like you're supposed to?

08:47.000 --> 08:47.710
Yeah.

08:48.250 --> 08:50.500
Eating well? Exercising?

08:51.330 --> 08:53.420
Yep, I'm doing everything.

08:54.130 --> 08:59.170
Meditation sharpens your perception
and helps you avoid dangerous places.

08:59.630 --> 09:03.540
Good health bolsters your life force
and keeps you from being cursed.

09:03.960 --> 09:04.790
I know.

09:05.580 --> 09:09.710
My Grandma's teaching me how to live with my condition.

09:10.540 --> 09:13.460
One of the reasons I was able to live a normal life again...

09:13.830 --> 09:17.290
was knowing that I could avoid
dragging other people into supernatural mishaps.

09:18.040 --> 09:23.170
Without my Grandma's help,
I might never have stepped foot outside ever again.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.630
Ready? Then let's begin.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.380
Y..Yayoi-chan?

09:33.380 --> 09:34.540
I'm gonna go watch.

09:34.880 --> 09:37.790
I don't think you should. She'll get upset if you do.

09:41.540 --> 09:44.170
Why don't I show you something cool while we wait?

09:44.540 --> 09:45.380
What is it?

09:46.880 --> 09:53.830
I have here a photo I took for Kei-kun's grandma
that shows what he hides under his glove.

09:54.170 --> 09:54.920
Show me.

09:55.330 --> 09:57.080
That was easy!

09:57.500 --> 09:59.250
Sorry, Kei-kun...

09:59.630 --> 10:00.380
Here.

10:01.790 --> 10:02.830
What is it?

10:02.830 --> 10:05.170
It looks like hair, right?

10:05.460 --> 10:08.250
It's not, though. They're actually...

10:09.170 --> 10:10.210
...his nerves.

10:11.750 --> 10:15.920
They slowly grow longer and get more and more painful.

10:16.830 --> 10:23.460
So they numb his hand and cut them away
while chanting Shinto prayers.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.920
Does that answer your questions?

10:29.130 --> 10:30.830
Something's off...

10:33.080 --> 10:34.630
My back's falling apart.

10:35.830 --> 10:37.580
Thanks, Grandma.

10:37.920 --> 10:38.830
Don't mention it!

10:38.830 --> 10:40.210
Hey, there!

10:40.710 --> 10:41.960
We brought drinks!

10:42.130 --> 10:43.880
Eiko! Yayoi-chan!

10:47.130 --> 10:48.250
Thanks.

10:49.960 --> 10:50.750
Keitaro?

10:52.290 --> 10:54.420
Sorry, my hand's still numb.

10:54.580 --> 10:57.670
Wow, Grandma. It's so much smaller.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.000
That's the whole point.

10:59.540 --> 11:03.830
But both of you are drained. You need to rest.

11:06.380 --> 11:07.960
I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

11:15.460 --> 11:16.670
These are his nerves?

11:16.960 --> 11:18.380
Careful you don't get cursed.

11:20.670 --> 11:21.830
Can I take some?

11:23.250 --> 11:25.170
What kind of creepy little...?

11:25.710 --> 11:28.170
You like scary stuff, kiddo?

11:28.540 --> 11:29.540
As much as I like curry.

11:29.540 --> 11:30.630
It's her favorite.

11:32.080 --> 11:34.960
I've got a fun story for you, then.

11:36.130 --> 11:37.670
I wanna hear.

11:39.000 --> 11:41.670
Our shrine holds memorial services for dolls.

11:42.000 --> 11:45.210
People bring us cursed dolls, and we take care of them.

11:45.670 --> 11:50.250
The most dangerous dolls get locked away
in the basement of the shrine sanctuary.

11:51.080 --> 11:57.290
No one is allowed down there,
and we make sure we warn everyone of the danger.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.290
I'm pretty tired...

12:10.130 --> 12:14.380
Did you get dropped on the way to the sanctuary?

12:17.790 --> 12:22.080
Grandma's pretty tired, so I could just take it myself.

12:23.130 --> 12:25.170
I know I shouldn't, but...

12:26.460 --> 12:32.380
What do you think happens to people
who go down into the basement anyway?

12:34.460 --> 12:39.960
Trapped in the sanctuary and unable to rest,
the dolls are desperate for a living body to possess.

12:40.460 --> 12:42.750
So watch out...

12:42.960 --> 12:45.170
...OR THEY'LL GET YOU!

12:47.630 --> 12:48.920
That was a fun story.

12:59.460 --> 13:02.790
Grandma, what do those dolls look like?

13:02.790 --> 13:05.710
Hmm? They're all Japanese dolls with long hair.

13:06.210 --> 13:10.170
The most dangerous one wears
a red flower-patterned kimono.

13:10.750 --> 13:12.330
I gotta go to the sanctuary.

13:12.420 --> 13:13.000
What?!

13:13.000 --> 13:14.960
Did you not hear a word I just said?

13:15.210 --> 13:15.830
I did.

13:16.250 --> 13:17.460
Yayoi-chan!

13:17.670 --> 13:20.420
Keitaro's possessed by one of the dolls.

13:22.000 --> 13:23.420
But he couldn't be...

13:23.420 --> 13:25.790
Your powers are still weakened.

13:26.420 --> 13:28.460
Keitaro's senses are weakened, too.

13:28.880 --> 13:30.630
That's probably how it got to him.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.460
I'll save him.

14:10.500 --> 14:11.380
It's dark...

14:12.710 --> 14:15.290
What was I doing...?

14:23.460 --> 14:25.170
This is bad...!

14:36.250 --> 14:37.500
Can't breathe...

14:38.210 --> 14:39.580
Listen here, Kei-chan.

14:40.170 --> 14:43.920
You must never go into the basement, all right?

14:44.080 --> 14:44.750
Okay!

14:46.210 --> 14:49.960
I was always so careful...

14:51.790 --> 14:53.580
Why...?

15:06.210 --> 15:07.330
Yayoi-chan!

15:23.290 --> 15:25.130
Don't mess with humans.

15:43.630 --> 15:46.330
Do it again...

15:47.500 --> 15:49.040
...and your heads are mine.

15:58.790 --> 16:00.710
Kei-kun! Yayoi-chan!

16:06.830 --> 16:08.080
Kei-chan!

16:08.080 --> 16:08.960
Are you okay?!

16:13.210 --> 16:14.290
I'm fine...

16:18.210 --> 16:20.580
Did this little kid...?

16:23.580 --> 16:25.420
She saved me again.

16:26.210 --> 16:28.580
And this time, it wasn't her fault.

16:29.750 --> 16:34.000
I let my guard down and got myself into this mess.

16:34.750 --> 16:36.960
Yayoi-chan put herself into danger...

16:39.170 --> 16:40.670
...to save me.

16:41.290 --> 16:42.130
Keitaro.

16:44.670 --> 16:48.130
Why're you defending this little brat?! She's dangerous!

16:48.210 --> 16:49.330
Grandma...

16:50.040 --> 16:55.630
I couldn't give her a good answer then,
but now I know what I would've said.

16:59.630 --> 17:00.630
Yayoi-chan...

17:04.130 --> 17:05.670
Drive home safe, now.

17:05.750 --> 17:07.540
We will. Thanks, Grandma.

17:07.880 --> 17:08.790
See you again soon!

17:09.040 --> 17:10.500
Yep. I'll be here.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.210
I'll be back, too.

17:12.210 --> 17:14.040
We're better off here without you, thanks.

17:17.710 --> 17:18.540
Grandma...

17:18.830 --> 17:19.540
Hmm?

17:20.040 --> 17:22.040
I wasn't sure how to say this earlier, but...

17:22.710 --> 17:24.330
Yayoi-chan's a good kid.

17:25.830 --> 17:28.080
Yes, she can get a little carried away sometimes...

17:28.460 --> 17:34.540
but practicing my people skills aside,
I want to meet her on her level.

17:35.460 --> 17:37.420
I mean, she's my first student ever.

17:38.790 --> 17:39.960
Kei-chan...

17:46.750 --> 17:48.540
Buy her some kind of souvenir and pray to it.

17:49.290 --> 17:54.330
That should calm the jizo that are hanging over her.

17:55.880 --> 18:01.790
Kei-chan, your ability to sense spirits
can protect you and your friends.

18:02.290 --> 18:05.250
It's not a curse, nor something to be ashamed of.

18:05.920 --> 18:08.710
If you ever need help, you can always come to me.

18:09.500 --> 18:10.290
I will.

18:11.080 --> 18:13.040
Thanks, Grandma.

18:19.290 --> 18:22.040
Thanks, Keitaro. I'll take good care of them.

18:22.210 --> 18:24.290
And that should take care of that...

18:24.290 --> 18:27.380
Wow, Kei's really going out of his way for you now!

18:27.580 --> 18:29.080
Could you not?

18:29.080 --> 18:31.540
Let's find a place for it together, Keitaro.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.880
I can also show you the collection in my room.

18:34.880 --> 18:36.330
Huh? What collection?

18:36.790 --> 18:39.790
Oh, Kei-kun, you're in for a surprise!

18:40.330 --> 18:41.330
Huh?

18:46.500 --> 18:49.830
Thanks for inviting me over, especially when it's so late...

18:49.830 --> 18:51.710
No worries! Come on in.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.960
<b>Yayoi</b>

18:52.670 --> 18:53.380
This way.

18:56.830 --> 19:00.330
Why didn't I notice it before?

19:18.500 --> 19:25.080
Until that door opened, I had no idea
this overwhelming presence was even here...

19:25.080 --> 19:26.420
Yayoi-chan?!

19:26.580 --> 19:30.420
W-wait, are they...? Are they all...?

19:30.630 --> 19:33.380
Yep. The worst of the worst.

19:40.960 --> 19:41.920
Yayoi-chan...

19:42.420 --> 19:44.960
Is that the same doll from today?!

19:44.960 --> 19:46.250
I brought it with me.

19:47.210 --> 19:50.330
Huh?! And Grandma let you?!

19:50.540 --> 19:52.040
I'll ask her later.

19:52.040 --> 19:55.210
It would've been too dangerous to leave it with her
when she's still weakened.

19:56.250 --> 19:58.580
That makes it dangerous for you, too, Yayoi-chan!

19:58.880 --> 19:59.830
I'll be safe.

20:01.630 --> 20:05.540
When spirits possess something,
they conform to its physical state.

20:08.420 --> 20:13.130
She reattached its head with my nerves...

20:14.250 --> 20:15.000
Watch...

20:15.670 --> 20:19.420
They slowly grow longer and get more and more painful.

20:24.750 --> 20:27.670
See? They're already in sync.

20:28.130 --> 20:33.460
I'm starting to regret saying
I wanted to meet her on her level...

20:34.460 --> 20:39.170
Every step I take towards her takes me further away
from the normal life I want to live...

20:40.210 --> 20:43.330
Am I gonna make it out of this okay?

20:46.170 --> 20:49.790
S-sorry! I didn't mean to scare you!

20:50.920 --> 20:52.330
E-Eiko?

20:53.330 --> 20:55.210
Are you okay? Can you stand?

20:55.710 --> 20:59.170
Wh-who cares about me, Eiko?!
We gotta get away from that room!

20:59.460 --> 21:01.580
It's so dangerous having all this stuff so close!

21:01.710 --> 21:02.830
You could get hurt, or...

21:04.130 --> 21:05.330
Calm down.

21:05.830 --> 21:12.670
It freaked me out at first, too.
But nothing weird or creepy has ever happened.

21:13.330 --> 21:15.380
She just likes to collect plushies, see?

21:16.330 --> 21:18.540
Eiko doesn't get it.

21:19.380 --> 21:20.790
She can't sense the things in there!

21:21.750 --> 21:25.420
She's... collecting spirits!

21:26.670 --> 21:28.170
Eiko's right.

21:29.130 --> 21:31.380
Nothing bad happens to the Hozukis.

21:31.830 --> 21:33.210
You'll be safe, too, Keitaro.

21:36.080 --> 21:36.960
I promise.

21:40.920 --> 21:41.790
So please...

21:45.710 --> 21:46.460
...gimme...

21:47.630 --> 21:48.580
...your nails.

23:22.080 --> 23:25.920
Consumed by his own fear of the supernatural
brought about by his curse,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.460
Keitaro cannot understand why Yayoi and Eiko
seek out supernatural encounters so purposefully.

23:31.420 --> 23:40.170
To free him from that fear and his curse,
Yayoi embarks on a quest for divine protection.
